ATTACHED TABLE ? Rules on the Imposition of Anti-Dumping Duties on Double-Layer Photosensitive Plates in Flat Form for Printing Plate-Making Originating in China

Anti-Dumping Duty Rates by Supplier of Goods Subject to Imposition (Related to Article 3)

Country of Supply: China

1. Lecai (Jiangsu Lecai Printing Material Co., Ltd.) and persons exporting products of that company.
   Anti-dumping duty rate: 4.10%.

2. Kodak [Kodak (China) Graphic Communications Company Limited]; the following related companies; and persons exporting products of those companies.
   Anti-dumping duty rate: 3.60%.
   (a) Kodak Investment [Kodak (China) Investment Co., Ltd.];
   (b) Kodak Korea (Kodak Korea Ltd.);
   (c) Eastman Kodak (Eastman Kodak Company);
   (d) Huaguang (Lucky Huaguang Graphics Co., Ltd.);
   (e) Huaguang Nanyang (Lucky Huaguang Nanyang Trading Co., Ltd.);
   (f) Huaguang Baoli (Suzhou Huaguang Baoli Printing Plate Material Co., Ltd.);
   (g) Zhongyin (Zhongyin Printing Equipment Co., Ltd.);
   (h) Agfa Huaguang [Agfa Huaguang (Shanghai) Printing Equipment Co., Ltd.];
   (i) Huafu (Henan Huafu Packaging Technology Co., Ltd.);
   (j) Kodak Electronic [Kodak Electronic Products (Shanghai) Company Limited].

3. Huafeng (Chongqing Huafeng Dijet Printing Material Co., Ltd.), its related company Huafeng PM (Chongqing Huafeng Printing Material Co., Ltd.), and persons exporting products of those companies.
   Anti-dumping duty rate: 7.61%.

4. All other suppliers.
   Anti-dumping duty rate: 4.87%.

NOTE: Where a supplier falling under item 4 has a special relationship under Article 23 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Customs Act with a supplier falling under any of items 1 through 3, the anti-dumping duty rate applicable to the supplier in items 1 through 3 with which that supplier has a special relationship shall apply, notwithstanding the rate specified for item 4.

The supplier names, ten lettered related companies, four distinct duty rates, the percent units, and the related-party exception are translated from the supplied Korean table. The separately stored HWP/PDF or graphic original is not independently certified as complete.
